  "stem": "The scatterplot shows the monthly rainfall \\(x\\), in millimeters, and the tea harvest \\(y\\), in hundreds of kilograms, for 8 months on a tea estate in Sri Lanka. The line of best fit has the equation \\(y = 0.2x + 12\\). According to the line of best fit, what monthly rainfall, in millimeters, corresponds to a predicted harvest of 60 hundred kilograms?",
  "figure": {
