    "240"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Set the prediction equal to 60: \\(0.2x + 12 = 60\\).",
    "Subtract 12: \\(0.2x = 48\\). Divide by 0.2: \\(x = 240\\) millimeters."
  ],
